WEBVTT

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
Worked on the series:
Lily, Tiramisu, Pineapple, Zinger, Biryulka, February,
Boss, Cockroach

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
How did I become

00:00:58.000 --> 00:01:04.020
queen

00:00:58.950 --> 00:01:03.920
FANSUB GROUP AZALIA PRESENTS

00:01:03.950 --> 00:01:06.390
All characters are fictitious

00:01:06.390 --> 00:01:08.960
and the events shown are fiction.

00:01:13.060 --> 02:01:37.060
AZALEA

00:01:21.800 --> 00:01:23.600
How much has she heard?

00:01:25.410 --> 00:01:27.170
The first thing she'll say

00:01:27.170 --> 00:01:29.380
under threat of death, will decide her fate.

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:32.010
She'll say she didn't hear anything

00:01:32.010 --> 00:01:34.550
or asks for her life, I will kill her.

00:01:34.550 --> 00:01:36.720
This will mean that she heard everything.

00:01:37.480 --> 00:01:38.890
You!

00:01:39.590 --> 00:01:42.120
You kill me, you make money for yourself
problems for the rest of your life.

00:01:47.490 --> 00:01:49.500
This is still a small thing.

00:01:54.370 --> 00:01:56.540
Move that thing away.

00:01:57.970 --> 00:01:59.370
Wait a moment.

00:01:59.370 --> 00:02:02.540
Episode 3

00:02:09.950 --> 00:02:12.790
Just so you know, today you hit the jackpot.

00:02:17.690 --> 00:02:20.290
Look, isn't it beautiful? Everything is yours.

00:02:20.760 --> 00:02:22.600
Is she stalling for time?

00:02:22.660 --> 00:02:25.430
What is this? Aren't you a thief?

00:02:26.000 --> 00:02:27.470
Crap.

00:02:27.870 --> 00:02:30.870
Do you even know who I am?

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:34.340
-I...
-Now she will say that she is the queen.

00:02:35.310 --> 00:02:37.880
served in special forces.

00:02:41.620 --> 00:02:43.020
Attack.

00:02:44.250 --> 00:02:46.720
Do you think all the cooks in the army are made with fingers?

00:02:46.990 --> 00:02:48.590
Army cook

00:02:48.590 --> 00:02:51.260
will kill a ghost with a kitchen knife.

00:02:51.390 --> 00:02:53.890
Forward! I'm not afraid of you.

00:02:54.030 --> 00:02:56.600
Come on attack.

00:02:56.600 --> 00:03:00.330
How can she say such strange things so confidently?

00:03:54.560 --> 00:03:56.020
And you're cool.

00:04:17.910 --> 00:04:19.780
His face is his weakness.

00:04:31.630 --> 00:04:33.160
Cool.

00:04:38.470 --> 00:04:40.000
God.

00:05:55.310 --> 00:05:57.310
His Majesty hides his face

00:05:57.310 --> 00:05:59.380
it means he doesn't want to reveal himself.

00:06:38.050 --> 00:06:39.620
Who are you?

00:06:42.290 --> 00:06:44.590
I am Kim Byungin from Kim Jwageun's family.

00:06:46.130 --> 00:06:47.860
What are you doing here?

00:06:50.300 --> 00:06:51.630
Have you been robbed?

00:06:51.630 --> 00:06:53.500
He couldn't go far.

00:06:54.500 --> 00:06:56.470
Search everything around.

00:06:56.700 --> 00:06:58.110
The thief was not alone.

00:06:58.110 --> 00:07:01.040
Yes, split up and search everything.

00:07:13.220 --> 00:07:15.120
Sister, are you okay?

00:07:18.490 --> 00:07:19.960
Sister?

00:07:22.500 --> 00:07:26.370
Why is he staring so ardently at his sister?

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:29.570
Soyeon!

00:07:31.510 --> 00:07:33.840
She must have been in a great shock.

00:07:35.880 --> 00:07:38.080
What scoundrel dared to do this to her?

00:07:47.190 --> 00:07:49.220
Golden... My God!

00:07:50.760 --> 00:07:53.030
- Well what.
-Why did you break in?

00:07:54.290 --> 00:07:55.730
We are looking for one thief.

00:07:55.730 --> 00:07:56.960
God.

00:07:56.960 --> 00:07:58.700
Where did you put your hands?

00:07:58.700 --> 00:08:02.270
They scared me, so I said my move out loud.

00:08:02.270 --> 00:08:03.370
This game is over.

00:08:03.370 --> 00:08:04.500
Who said this?

00:08:04.500 --> 00:08:06.310
Will you continue knowing what I have in my hands?

00:08:06.310 --> 00:08:08.980
Your problem is why should I lose?

00:08:08.980 --> 00:08:10.710
What a scoundrel.

00:08:12.250 --> 00:08:13.550
Sorry, I overdid it.

00:08:13.550 --> 00:08:15.980
Did you just spit in my face?

00:08:15.980 --> 00:08:17.520
I don't know anything!

00:08:20.050 --> 00:08:21.960
Damn you!

00:08:24.490 --> 00:08:27.130
-Arrest him.
-Arrest?

00:08:28.200 --> 00:08:30.200
What stood up like pillars?

00:08:30.200 --> 00:08:32.000
Don't let Councilor Hong escape,

00:08:32.000 --> 00:08:33.830
close the door and get out now!

00:08:33.830 --> 00:08:36.900
He doesn’t know how to fight himself, but makes a mess of himself.

00:08:36.900 --> 00:08:39.910
Today I’ll cut his temper short!

00:08:40.870 --> 00:08:42.840
-Protect me.
-Next time.

00:08:42.840 --> 00:08:45.410
-Next?
-Why are you still here?

00:08:45.550 --> 00:08:48.050
If you just leave...

00:08:48.050 --> 00:08:49.520
Adviser Hon.

00:08:49.520 --> 00:08:52.690
Today I will cut your temper short!

00:08:54.860 --> 00:08:56.460
It turned out convincingly.

00:08:59.590 --> 00:09:02.400
Can't I even make fun of you anymore?

00:09:02.400 --> 00:09:04.760
Will you really raise a sword against me?

00:09:07.200 --> 00:09:09.900
Just not there! I never got around to getting married!

00:09:10.200 --> 00:09:11.640
Let's go.

00:09:12.810 --> 00:09:15.480
Missed. Even the sword is not on your side.

00:09:35.160 --> 00:09:36.960
Are you hurt?

00:09:36.960 --> 00:09:38.630
I'm fine.

00:09:39.470 --> 00:09:41.670
I didn't think Kim Byungin would be with her.

00:09:42.600 --> 00:09:44.640
Do you think it was a trap?

00:09:45.370 --> 00:09:48.010
They wouldn't use the queen as bait.

00:09:48.010 --> 00:09:50.080
Moreover, the queen's reaction

00:09:50.080 --> 00:09:53.050
was unusual.
It doesn't give me peace.

00:09:53.280 --> 00:09:55.180
If we start acting without understanding it,

00:09:55.180 --> 00:09:57.380
We'll only make it worse.

00:09:57.720 --> 00:09:59.890
Let's first understand what's going on.

00:09:59.890 --> 00:10:01.450
But what,

00:10:01.820 --> 00:10:04.220
if the queen heard everything?

00:10:05.630 --> 00:10:08.160
I spoke to the queen.

00:10:08.860 --> 00:10:11.000
Trust my judgment.

00:10:13.970 --> 00:10:16.340
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:10:17.070 --> 00:10:20.040
If I'm wrong

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:26.480
a bloodbath will begin.

00:10:33.890 --> 00:10:37.190
Episode 3: In bed with the enemy

00:10:48.470 --> 00:10:49.770
Noble guest.

00:10:49.770 --> 00:10:52.070
I saw him in the coffin
unless it's the king...

00:10:52.970 --> 00:10:55.170
Put away your weapon, put it away.

00:10:59.550 --> 00:11:01.050
Skip it.

00:11:07.650 --> 00:11:10.320
I would like our visit to remain a secret.

00:11:10.320 --> 00:11:11.820
Yes.

00:11:20.330 --> 00:11:21.830
God.

00:11:26.570 --> 00:11:28.940
She fainted from fear.

00:11:28.980 --> 00:11:33.410
Prepare her bed and nurse her secretly.

00:11:33.410 --> 00:11:34.850
Yes.

00:11:58.940 --> 00:12:00.840
Your Highness, what are you doing here?

00:12:01.340 --> 00:12:03.240
You again.

00:12:04.940 --> 00:12:08.780
You're the only one looking for me when I run away.

00:12:09.650 --> 00:12:14.090
Tomorrow is your wedding.
Why are you here?

00:12:14.890 --> 00:12:17.920
I thought that a little longer and I would go crazy.
That's why she left the palace.

00:12:19.230 --> 00:12:20.930
Just go for me

00:12:22.200 --> 00:12:23.760
nowhere.

00:12:50.920 --> 00:12:55.960
I will return you to the palace without anyone noticing.

00:12:58.670 --> 00:13:01.300
Tomorrow is my childhood dream

00:13:02.670 --> 00:13:05.070
will come true.

00:13:05.970 --> 00:13:08.910
I dreamed of becoming a queen.

00:13:12.610 --> 00:13:15.450
Tomorrow my dream will come true.

00:13:18.590 --> 00:13:20.720
Tomorrow is my dream

00:13:23.060 --> 00:13:24.920
will disappear.

00:13:28.960 --> 00:13:30.830
Is something wrong?

00:13:32.700 --> 00:13:34.730
I'm scared.

00:13:35.740 --> 00:13:37.340
I'm scared.

00:13:38.570 --> 00:13:41.070
It's scary to live.

00:13:41.140 --> 00:13:44.180
-Your Highness.
-Don't call me that.

00:13:45.150 --> 00:13:47.880
At least today call me by name.

00:13:48.580 --> 00:13:50.780
So that I don't forget who I am.

00:13:52.690 --> 00:13:54.350
To

00:13:56.590 --> 00:13:58.290
I haven't lost myself.

00:13:59.160 --> 00:14:01.790
What are you so afraid of?

00:14:02.400 --> 00:14:06.100
I am not me at all.

00:14:06.930 --> 00:14:09.500
All this time I lived thinking that this is me.

00:14:10.670 --> 00:14:12.410
But that was not the case.

00:14:12.470 --> 00:14:15.740
There is nothing real about me, everything is a lie.

00:14:32.030 --> 00:14:34.190
You are Soyeon.

00:14:39.370 --> 00:14:41.730
A woman I've known for many years

00:14:44.570 --> 00:14:47.940
secretly loved and treasured.

00:14:57.120 --> 00:14:59.350
I won't let you lose yourself.

00:15:03.920 --> 00:15:05.990
And I will never forget.

00:15:57.680 --> 00:15:59.180
So what?

00:16:01.280 --> 00:16:03.780
happened that night?

00:16:08.020 --> 00:16:10.890
Someone kill me.

00:16:12.790 --> 00:16:15.760
I called a doctor. Wait, Your Majesty.

00:16:18.060 --> 00:16:19.770
This charlatan.

00:16:20.270 --> 00:16:21.630
I already have a headache.

00:16:21.630 --> 00:16:23.470
Don't let it show here.

00:16:23.470 --> 00:16:26.510
Otherwise, he will be left without a reproductive organ.

00:16:30.180 --> 00:16:33.450
Then maybe you can eat? Hold it.

00:16:39.650 --> 00:16:42.320
I feel sick. Looks like he's about to throw up.

00:16:43.120 --> 00:16:45.090
And how much did you drink yesterday?

00:16:45.090 --> 00:16:47.760
This woman does not tolerate alcohol well.

00:16:48.130 --> 00:16:50.560
I haven't switched off like this in a long time.

00:16:53.200 --> 00:16:55.130
How did I get back yesterday?

00:16:56.340 --> 00:16:59.410
Your cousin, Mr. Benin, brought you.

00:16:59.410 --> 00:17:02.140
You could get into trouble.

00:17:02.980 --> 00:17:04.810
Thanks to him, only me

00:17:04.810 --> 00:17:06.880
I know that you went out yesterday.

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:08.510
My brother?

00:17:08.580 --> 00:17:10.550
Where did we meet him?

00:17:10.880 --> 00:17:12.750
I don't know for sure.

00:17:13.520 --> 00:17:17.190
By the way, he said that you
fainted from fright.

00:17:17.190 --> 00:17:19.660
-What scared you?
-I didn't pass out.

00:17:19.660 --> 00:17:21.660
I drank until I passed out.

00:17:21.760 --> 00:17:24.200
By the way, it's cool to be a queen.

00:17:24.200 --> 00:17:25.970
The gates were opened during curfew.

00:17:25.970 --> 00:17:28.000
He's your cousin

00:17:28.000 --> 00:17:30.140
and adopted son Kim Jwageun.

00:17:30.140 --> 00:17:31.670
How's that?

00:17:36.840 --> 00:17:38.280
Where is Court Lady Choi?

00:17:38.280 --> 00:17:39.780
Late?

00:17:40.910 --> 00:17:42.980
Your brother sent her away from the palace,

00:17:42.980 --> 00:17:45.620
so that no one knows that you are sick with a hangover.

00:17:46.020 --> 00:17:47.690
She didn't want to leave

00:17:47.690 --> 00:17:50.920
it was difficult to force her.

00:17:50.920 --> 00:17:54.390
Why is everyone so reluctant to leave the palace?

00:17:54.730 --> 00:17:57.930
It's dangerous outside the palace.

00:17:58.160 --> 00:18:01.070
Everything you need is in the palace.

00:18:01.430 --> 00:18:04.070
Everyone here is hypnotized, or what?

00:18:04.070 --> 00:18:06.510
There is something that cannot be found in the palace.

00:18:06.610 --> 00:18:08.340
-What is this?
-Freedom.

00:18:10.540 --> 00:18:12.980
Outside the palace everything is the same.

00:18:13.650 --> 00:18:17.350
Okay, I'm glad she's gone. She nags me.

00:18:17.420 --> 00:18:19.990
My little head.

00:18:21.520 --> 00:18:24.060
I need some spicy ramen for my hangover.

00:18:24.060 --> 00:18:26.730
and sweat. Great medicine.

00:18:27.860 --> 00:18:29.900
There's no ramen here.

00:18:29.900 --> 00:18:32.330
And hangover drinks.

00:18:35.100 --> 00:18:37.400
But here I have power.

00:18:39.910 --> 00:18:41.870
God.

00:18:42.410 --> 00:18:43.910
Light the fire.

00:18:44.440 --> 00:18:45.580
-Light the fire.
-Light the fire.

00:18:45.580 --> 00:18:48.980
I have no idea what she wants.

00:18:48.980 --> 00:18:50.050
And what?

00:18:50.050 --> 00:18:52.320
Meal for the Daejojeon Hall.

00:18:52.320 --> 00:18:53.720
Yeah.

00:18:57.820 --> 00:18:59.490
What nonsense is this?

00:19:12.110 --> 00:19:14.010
Is the meat cooked?

00:19:33.660 --> 00:19:35.260
That's not it.

00:19:36.730 --> 00:19:38.830
Well, okay. This time...

00:19:49.210 --> 00:19:52.280
Damn. Is this all he can do?

00:19:55.450 --> 00:19:58.620
What's wrong with my food? What the hell?

00:20:12.060 --> 00:20:14.330
Phew, healthy eating.

00:20:30.320 --> 00:20:31.920
Not spicy at all.

00:20:37.760 --> 00:20:40.530
Very spicy. Did you want to kill me?

00:20:45.970 --> 00:20:47.570
I've had enough!

00:20:47.570 --> 00:20:49.970
If you don't like it, let him come here and cook!

00:20:49.970 --> 00:20:53.610
One disorder. I'll cook it myself.

00:20:59.710 --> 00:21:01.410
The stove has the power of fire,

00:21:01.410 --> 00:21:03.120
but fire is difficult to control.

00:21:03.120 --> 00:21:06.550
The thermal conductivity of the boiler is quite high.

00:21:09.720 --> 00:21:11.860
What if you get hurt, Your Majesty?

00:21:11.860 --> 00:21:13.160
You haven't been in the kitchen since

00:21:13.160 --> 00:21:14.830
how we stopped playing house.

00:21:14.830 --> 00:21:17.430
Even if I only came here to play house,

00:21:17.760 --> 00:21:19.600
I cook better than him.

00:21:23.640 --> 00:21:25.170
Be careful, Your Majesty.

00:21:25.170 --> 00:21:27.270
Are you holding it like that?

00:21:27.640 --> 00:21:29.540
Take care of your fingers.

00:21:34.480 --> 00:21:35.980
Your Majesty.

00:21:42.560 --> 00:21:45.160
This is my first time cooking, so I don’t know if it’s right.

00:21:45.160 --> 00:21:48.790
Looks like it needs to be cut like this.

00:22:51.490 --> 00:22:52.990
Yes.

00:23:06.070 --> 00:23:08.640
I'm sure it just looks beautiful.

00:23:08.640 --> 00:23:10.880
I bet it's not really seasoned.

00:23:11.280 --> 00:23:12.950
Certainly.

00:23:12.950 --> 00:23:15.550
Yes. You are absolutely right.

00:23:15.550 --> 00:23:16.980
Let me in.

00:23:17.450 --> 00:23:21.150
I've worked in the royal kitchen for 30 years.

00:23:21.150 --> 00:23:23.390
Cooking is the height of skill.

00:23:24.890 --> 00:23:26.190
OK.

00:23:26.190 --> 00:23:29.330
I'll try it myself to understand how terrible it is.

00:23:29.430 --> 00:23:31.530
It's not tasty at all.

00:23:43.140 --> 00:23:46.180
God.

00:23:55.550 --> 00:23:57.160
Is everything that bad?

00:23:59.430 --> 00:24:01.060
Shiitake aroma

00:24:01.730 --> 00:24:03.360
and green onions.

00:24:05.660 --> 00:24:07.970
Rich aroma of meat.

00:24:09.340 --> 00:24:12.840
The flavors of the three ingredients mix. And this...

00:24:25.520 --> 00:24:28.750
“Sam” is three, “hyang” is aroma,

00:24:28.750 --> 00:24:31.120
and "ra" - pot.

00:24:31.120 --> 00:24:33.730
Three flavors in a pot,

00:24:33.730 --> 00:24:35.790
"samhyanra".

00:24:38.230 --> 00:24:43.470
Samhyang ramen!

00:25:11.000 --> 00:25:13.270
Exactly as needed.

00:25:13.270 --> 00:25:16.040
Monosodium glutamate would go there.

00:25:16.040 --> 00:25:17.600
But it's better than nothing.

00:25:19.070 --> 00:25:22.880
Thanks to you, I have tried many delicacies,

00:25:22.880 --> 00:25:25.940
but nothing that amazing.

00:25:25.980 --> 00:25:27.550
Try again.

00:25:28.850 --> 00:25:33.050
Know that if you are offered ramen, this is true love.

00:25:34.020 --> 00:25:36.160
Then if you don't mind.

00:25:43.600 --> 00:25:45.560
This is so...

00:25:46.400 --> 00:25:48.330
You, who have never held a knife before,

00:25:48.330 --> 00:25:50.300
You cook better than a royal chef.

00:25:50.470 --> 00:25:53.640
Is there something you can't do?

00:25:55.040 --> 00:25:59.240
I was the perfect person, capable of anything.

00:25:59.850 --> 00:26:02.180
But now I can’t do the most important thing.

00:26:02.820 --> 00:26:06.250
What I was a pro at and what I loved most.

00:26:08.190 --> 00:26:11.420
It's clear. Embroidery?

00:26:11.820 --> 00:26:14.590
Exactly. You did well.

00:26:16.030 --> 00:26:17.500
Yes.

00:26:17.900 --> 00:26:19.770
When I touched

00:26:19.770 --> 00:26:23.600
flowers were blooming and butterflies were fluttering.

00:26:23.870 --> 00:26:26.410
It was something.

00:26:29.070 --> 00:26:31.980
His Majesty is here.

00:26:32.550 --> 00:26:34.510
Why now?

00:26:34.510 --> 00:26:37.280
Crap. The noodles will soften.

00:26:39.720 --> 00:26:41.120
Hot.

00:26:44.920 --> 00:26:46.460
My Queen.

00:26:57.040 --> 00:26:58.840
In the morning I visited the elders

00:26:58.840 --> 00:27:01.970
and I was wondering how you were feeling, so I paid a visit.

00:27:02.840 --> 00:27:05.080
Does he know about last night?

00:27:05.440 --> 00:27:07.680
There is no reason to feel unwell.

00:27:07.880 --> 00:27:10.450
How was your night?

00:27:10.450 --> 00:27:12.050
Let's change the subject.

00:27:12.050 --> 00:27:14.090
She changes the subject.

00:27:14.950 --> 00:27:16.560
By your prayers.

00:27:19.490 --> 00:27:22.660
Queen, have you been drinking?

00:27:23.730 --> 00:27:26.500
Me? Of course not.

00:27:26.500 --> 00:27:28.200
Haven't you been drinking?

00:27:33.370 --> 00:27:35.010
Are we playing staring contest?

00:27:39.680 --> 00:27:42.550
I didn't know you were such a good liar.

00:27:50.320 --> 00:27:52.060
Oh, sorry.

00:27:52.320 --> 00:27:54.130
I don't usually do this

00:27:54.130 --> 00:27:56.460
but you came too close.

00:27:59.970 --> 00:28:02.200
My nose almost fell off.

00:28:02.770 --> 00:28:04.440
I have a lot to do. Sorry.

00:28:04.440 --> 00:28:06.310
Your Majesty.

00:28:08.240 --> 00:28:10.080
I'll go to Seonjeongjeong Hall.

00:28:10.080 --> 00:28:11.580
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:28:15.880 --> 00:28:19.080
He doesn't look like he's very busy.
But if so, why did you come here?

00:28:20.720 --> 00:28:23.360
Damn, now she's softened.

00:28:33.270 --> 00:28:35.470
Greetings, king.

00:28:35.470 --> 00:28:36.940
Brother.

00:28:37.100 --> 00:28:39.510
Come closer

00:28:39.510 --> 00:28:41.840
and tell me, do I stink?

00:28:41.840 --> 00:28:43.380
Does it stink?

00:28:43.810 --> 00:28:45.780
I can't say yet.

00:28:46.210 --> 00:28:48.410
Get everything ready.

00:28:51.120 --> 00:28:54.020
What the hell did my queen eat?

00:28:54.190 --> 00:28:57.220
What a shame!

00:29:05.230 --> 00:29:08.430
Your Majesty, Kim Byungin has arrived.

00:29:08.970 --> 00:29:11.500
Eh, brother?

00:29:13.170 --> 00:29:16.240
I owe you so much for last night.

00:29:16.240 --> 00:29:18.780
I did what I had to do.

00:29:22.450 --> 00:29:25.280
Since I have a guest, I should offer tea.

00:29:25.280 --> 00:29:27.050
I missed you.

00:29:27.650 --> 00:29:29.620
It fell on my head again.

00:29:29.620 --> 00:29:32.160
OK. We have to play along.

00:29:32.220 --> 00:29:34.490
I missed you too.

00:29:35.930 --> 00:29:37.600
Glad to hear.

00:29:38.100 --> 00:29:42.200
Your words dispelled my worries.

00:29:42.300 --> 00:29:44.740
What moved him so much?

00:29:44.740 --> 00:29:46.570
I've heard rumors

00:29:47.340 --> 00:29:50.010
that you fell into the lake after meeting me.

00:29:50.010 --> 00:29:52.280
That day they said they were scared.

00:29:52.510 --> 00:29:54.110
What is it about?

00:29:55.480 --> 00:29:59.150
I said that day that I was scared...

00:29:59.150 --> 00:30:02.390
And I was afraid?..

00:30:04.120 --> 00:30:08.090
There is nothing worse in the world than people.

00:30:08.460 --> 00:30:10.760
Are you being threatened?

00:30:11.460 --> 00:30:13.730
Do you know who pushed

00:30:13.730 --> 00:30:15.270
you into the lake

00:30:15.270 --> 00:30:16.900
and attacked last night?

00:30:17.600 --> 00:30:19.100
Stand.

00:30:19.200 --> 00:30:21.140
I know about the lake.

00:30:21.170 --> 00:30:23.540
What about last night?

00:30:24.240 --> 00:30:27.010
-What are you talking about?
-You don't remember?

00:30:27.380 --> 00:30:29.620
They tried to kill you last night.

00:30:29.620 --> 00:30:31.120
Kill?

00:30:31.420 --> 00:30:33.120
Did I almost die?

00:30:33.120 --> 00:30:34.950
Who was it? Why me?

00:30:34.950 --> 00:30:36.960
I hoped you knew

00:30:37.860 --> 00:30:39.490
but I see no.

00:30:40.060 --> 00:30:43.930
What? Have two people already tried to kill her?

00:30:44.430 --> 00:30:46.060
Is this woman in danger?

00:30:46.060 --> 00:30:47.770
The day you fell into the lake

00:30:47.770 --> 00:30:51.270
you said you were scared. I think it has something to do with it.

00:30:51.540 --> 00:30:55.010
Looks like you don't know yet.
I have memory problems.

00:30:55.010 --> 00:30:58.540
You better know what we talked about.

00:30:59.750 --> 00:31:01.250
Are you true

00:31:03.920 --> 00:31:06.550
have you forgotten everything about that day?

00:31:06.550 --> 00:31:09.320
Yes, I don't remember anything.

00:31:12.220 --> 00:31:13.760
It doesn't matter.

00:31:13.760 --> 00:31:15.960
Tell me, this su...

00:31:16.560 --> 00:31:20.500
What did that bastard do to me yesterday?

00:31:21.000 --> 00:31:23.240
It was nearing curfew.

00:31:23.240 --> 00:31:24.970
Judging by the way he wielded the sword

00:31:24.970 --> 00:31:28.170
and he was dressed, he was not an ordinary person.

00:31:28.440 --> 00:31:30.580
I don't know how many there were

00:31:30.640 --> 00:31:33.040
but they helped him.

00:31:33.050 --> 00:31:35.610
If it weren't for you, I would be dead.

00:31:35.610 --> 00:31:38.420
I'm so glad we met yesterday.

00:31:44.390 --> 00:31:45.860
A?

00:31:51.560 --> 00:31:53.270
Hey.

00:31:58.240 --> 00:32:00.840
Why did you leave the palace last night?

00:32:00.840 --> 00:32:03.880
I got bored and decided to take a walk.

00:32:05.640 --> 00:32:09.580
If the Queen Dowager finds out,

00:32:09.580 --> 00:32:12.120
I'm in trouble.

00:32:12.550 --> 00:32:15.690
Not only will my freedom of movement be curtailed,

00:32:15.690 --> 00:32:17.660
but Hongyeon is also executed.

00:32:18.260 --> 00:32:21.230
Can you keep this a secret?

00:32:21.590 --> 00:32:23.930
But we need to find the culprit.

00:32:24.360 --> 00:32:26.260
Do it quietly.

00:32:26.330 --> 00:32:29.200
I'm going to get in trouble, you know?

00:32:30.200 --> 00:32:31.700
Understand.

00:32:31.700 --> 00:32:34.070
Who knew that you left the palace?

00:32:34.070 --> 00:32:36.270
Only Hongyong.

00:32:37.340 --> 00:32:40.310
I'll have people watch her.

00:32:40.310 --> 00:32:44.550
No, she is faithful to me, she is even ready to die for me.

00:32:44.550 --> 00:32:45.980
She has nothing to do with it.

00:32:45.980 --> 00:32:49.960
Your Majesty, don't trust anyone.

00:32:49.960 --> 00:32:51.890
I've known her for a long time too

00:32:51.890 --> 00:32:54.530
but those closest to you are always more dangerous.

00:32:55.260 --> 00:32:58.700
Just because you're in the palace doesn't mean you're not in danger. No.

00:33:00.530 --> 00:33:02.800
It's even more dangerous here.

00:33:03.200 --> 00:33:07.110
Exactly, I completely forgot where I am.

00:33:07.110 --> 00:33:09.210
In a palace full of intrigue.

00:33:09.210 --> 00:33:12.780
A place where your life is always in the balance.

00:33:14.480 --> 00:33:16.780
Don't worry.

00:33:16.920 --> 00:33:19.380
I will protect you.

00:33:19.950 --> 00:33:21.720
Thanks, but

00:33:21.950 --> 00:33:23.720
I can handle it myself.

00:33:24.860 --> 00:33:27.290
Now is not the time to relax.

00:33:27.590 --> 00:33:31.060
Don't try to appear strong in front of me.

00:33:47.610 --> 00:33:49.750
Maybe you forgot

00:33:50.180 --> 00:33:52.320
but I will remember forever.

00:33:52.750 --> 00:33:55.950
The memory of that night will forever remain in my heart.

00:34:01.230 --> 00:34:04.330
I will find out who it was at any cost.

00:34:11.200 --> 00:34:14.440
This is where they sell silk yarn

00:34:14.940 --> 00:34:16.410
from Qing?

00:34:36.190 --> 00:34:39.500
I heard that you have valuable goods from the Qing, so I came.

00:34:46.240 --> 00:34:49.010
Rumors fly fast.

00:34:50.840 --> 00:34:52.280
Please.

00:35:08.560 --> 00:35:13.530
Do you store valuables in such a creepy place?

00:35:14.470 --> 00:35:16.970
Because they are valuable.

00:35:30.250 --> 00:35:31.680
Here.

00:35:31.850 --> 00:35:33.550
What is this?

00:35:34.850 --> 00:35:37.820
Close one eye.

00:35:38.290 --> 00:35:42.230
And then turn around. That's how it works.

00:35:42.230 --> 00:35:44.560
Master! Here?

00:35:44.560 --> 00:35:46.060
I'm coming!

00:35:46.830 --> 00:35:48.900
It seems you misunderstood me.

00:35:48.900 --> 00:35:51.540
I'm looking for silk yarn...

00:35:53.570 --> 00:35:55.740
I wanted to buy yarn.

00:35:56.610 --> 00:35:59.380
What should I do with this pipe?

00:36:17.230 --> 00:36:20.000
Kim Byungin said not to trust anyone.

00:36:20.000 --> 00:36:21.670
So how can you trust him?

00:36:22.230 --> 00:36:24.370
Hongyeon wouldn't harm me.

00:36:24.640 --> 00:36:27.110
Maybe Cho Hwajin again?

00:36:28.140 --> 00:36:29.470
A week is an eternity.

00:36:29.470 --> 00:36:31.580
So it won't take long to die.

00:36:32.280 --> 00:36:33.880
I'll do what I'm good at.

00:36:33.880 --> 00:36:35.580
I will win with food.

00:36:35.610 --> 00:36:37.520
It will defeat any armor.

00:36:37.520 --> 00:36:39.620
And it will work on the Queen Dowager.

00:36:42.650 --> 00:36:44.090
Just a minute.

00:36:44.260 --> 00:36:46.690
Is this the Queen Dowager's leftover food?

00:36:46.690 --> 00:36:48.190
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:36:50.300 --> 00:36:52.600
Let me take a look.

00:36:52.800 --> 00:36:54.570
Leftovers can provide insight

00:36:54.570 --> 00:36:56.940
about health and preferences.

00:36:56.940 --> 00:36:59.600
You can't look at them.

00:36:59.600 --> 00:37:01.040
Remove it.

00:37:01.340 --> 00:37:03.980
What are you doing? I'm the queen.

00:37:03.980 --> 00:37:05.480
I'm sorry,

00:37:05.480 --> 00:37:07.780
but I am the royal cook.

00:37:07.780 --> 00:37:09.680
This means that in the kitchen -

00:37:09.680 --> 00:37:11.980
I'm the king.

00:37:12.880 --> 00:37:15.650
Then let our skills speak for themselves.

00:37:16.790 --> 00:37:18.460
Let's see who's king here.

00:37:21.190 --> 00:37:23.030
Don't say that.

00:37:23.160 --> 00:37:26.460
It's time for me to cook. Farewell.

00:37:26.830 --> 00:37:29.370
What, you were afraid to lose?

00:37:30.040 --> 00:37:32.970
To the person in the kitchen
only played as a child?

00:37:46.850 --> 00:37:50.050
Well, how are the preparations?..

00:38:19.380 --> 00:38:20.920
Gods!

00:38:23.790 --> 00:38:25.520
Queen!

00:38:25.520 --> 00:38:28.390
Queen!

00:38:28.390 --> 00:38:30.630
Royal Chef!

00:38:30.630 --> 00:38:46.810
-Queen!
-Royal cook!

00:38:57.520 --> 00:38:59.220
Stop.

00:39:04.230 --> 00:39:05.760
No!

00:39:07.870 --> 00:39:09.300
Crap.

00:39:12.540 --> 00:39:14.040
Cooking

00:39:14.640 --> 00:39:16.470
Speed is important.

00:39:16.470 --> 00:39:19.340
But taste is even more important.

00:39:19.340 --> 00:39:20.850
Right.

00:39:26.620 --> 00:39:28.950
-You.
-What did you want?

00:39:28.950 --> 00:39:31.360
Judging by your clothes, you don't work here.

00:39:31.360 --> 00:39:32.420
What is your position?

00:39:32.420 --> 00:39:34.830
I'm checking the royal offerings.

00:39:34.830 --> 00:39:37.130
Chief Inspector of the Royal Kitchen.

00:39:37.330 --> 00:39:40.030
-Then test the food.
-I?

00:39:40.470 --> 00:39:41.930
Everyone present here

00:39:41.930 --> 00:39:44.200
will not be able to honestly evaluate the food.

00:39:44.200 --> 00:39:45.800
Go ahead, try it.

00:39:46.870 --> 00:39:48.370
Yes, Your Majesty.

00:39:51.640 --> 00:39:53.140
As you say.

00:40:06.190 --> 00:40:10.060
I haven't tried anything like this until now.

00:40:10.330 --> 00:40:11.660
Like bliss

00:40:11.660 --> 00:40:14.430
This dish makes my mouth happy.

00:40:14.670 --> 00:40:19.470
In my entire life my tongue has never tasted anything more beautiful...

00:40:19.500 --> 00:40:20.970
Well...

00:40:28.210 --> 00:40:29.810
Who are you?

00:40:38.590 --> 00:40:41.990
How dare a girl enter the royal kitchen?

00:40:41.990 --> 00:40:44.260
Brat.

00:40:47.600 --> 00:40:49.730
Was this meant for me?

00:40:49.970 --> 00:40:53.240
How dare a girl enter the royal kitchen?

00:40:57.210 --> 00:41:01.080
No. Of course not.

00:41:07.190 --> 00:41:10.020
Your Majesty.

00:41:12.490 --> 00:41:13.890
Enough.

00:41:14.590 --> 00:41:16.460
I was the first

00:41:16.460 --> 00:41:18.500
and my food tastes great.

00:41:20.700 --> 00:41:23.130
While I'm in the kitchen

00:41:23.330 --> 00:41:25.300
my word is law.

00:41:26.840 --> 00:41:28.440
You will work with me.

00:41:28.910 --> 00:41:30.440
-Yes, Your Majesty.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

00:41:30.440 --> 00:41:31.910
She's not enough...

00:41:35.410 --> 00:41:40.620
If you want, I can take you on as a student.

00:41:43.620 --> 00:41:47.460
Your Majesty, His Majesty is now in the Daejojeon Hall.

00:41:54.570 --> 00:41:56.930
To what do I owe such an early visit?

00:41:57.040 --> 00:41:59.200
I missed you my queen.

00:41:59.900 --> 00:42:02.340
And you are really cute today.

00:42:02.870 --> 00:42:05.480
But isn't it time for you to return to yourself?

00:42:05.480 --> 00:42:08.050
-Special forces.
-What?

00:42:09.480 --> 00:42:12.180
Is there something you want to tell me about this word?

00:42:12.220 --> 00:42:14.590
-What is this, some kind of game?
-Well...

00:42:15.590 --> 00:42:18.160
It's time for you to go.

00:42:19.590 --> 00:42:21.130
Army cook.

00:42:21.490 --> 00:42:22.960
What?

00:42:24.230 --> 00:42:26.360
God. Well, really, you are the king.

00:42:26.360 --> 00:42:28.570
Now I’ll say something, and you’ll execute me for it?

00:42:28.570 --> 00:42:30.100
Continue.

00:42:31.000 --> 00:42:33.270
What nonsense are you talking about?

00:42:38.080 --> 00:42:40.410
You use foul language for no reason.

00:42:40.410 --> 00:42:43.210
You must be unhappy with your life.

00:42:43.210 --> 00:42:45.580
Tell me everything that's bothering you.

00:42:45.580 --> 00:42:48.290
If you want, I can even stay.

00:42:48.490 --> 00:42:50.320
What are you saying, everything is fine with me.

00:42:50.320 --> 00:42:53.990
Yes, I really can’t get enough of how wonderful my life is.

00:42:55.290 --> 00:42:57.760
Have you seen anyone today?

00:42:59.000 --> 00:43:00.270
What are you talking about?

00:43:00.270 --> 00:43:02.100
How much has she heard?

00:43:02.230 --> 00:43:05.100
I just want to know how your day was.

00:43:05.240 --> 00:43:07.870
I'll leave after we talk a little.

00:43:11.780 --> 00:43:15.250
Well, my cousin came to see me.

00:43:16.480 --> 00:43:17.780
Cousin?

00:43:17.780 --> 00:43:20.280
Kim Byongin, if I'm not mistaken?

00:43:20.350 --> 00:43:21.620
What did he need?

00:43:21.620 --> 00:43:25.560
Why do I feel like I'm being interrogated?

00:43:25.690 --> 00:43:27.390
You're too impressionable.

00:43:27.530 --> 00:43:30.190
I'm just worried about my relatives

00:43:30.190 --> 00:43:31.830
something happened.

00:43:31.830 --> 00:43:33.130
Not really.

00:43:33.130 --> 00:43:35.170
I just came to say hello and congratulate you.

00:43:35.170 --> 00:43:37.600
If so, then I don’t have to worry about them.

00:43:38.040 --> 00:43:42.140
May I ask why you have been treating me this way lately?

00:43:43.140 --> 00:43:46.610
She hates me because she knows I'm a murderer?

00:43:47.150 --> 00:43:49.050
We are now husband and wife.

00:43:49.050 --> 00:43:50.780
Even if you love madly,

00:43:50.780 --> 00:43:52.850
After the wedding, romance fades away.

00:43:53.320 --> 00:43:56.090
Are you satisfied? You can go.

00:43:56.920 --> 00:44:00.830
Listen to me. Bring bed linen.

00:44:00.890 --> 00:44:03.700
What are you doing? We didn't agree that way.

00:44:03.700 --> 00:44:06.300
Conversations have tired me,

00:44:06.300 --> 00:44:09.030
I don’t have the strength to return to Hijeongjon.

00:44:12.970 --> 00:44:16.310
Victory by day, setback by night.

00:44:23.110 --> 00:44:25.480
He's kind of suspicious.

00:44:26.820 --> 00:44:28.890
She's kind of suspicious.

00:44:33.590 --> 00:44:34.990
Your Majesty,

00:44:35.160 --> 00:44:37.800
you shouldn't trust anyone.

00:44:37.830 --> 00:44:41.230
Yes, he definitely has no faith.

00:44:41.230 --> 00:44:43.000
No matter where or when

00:44:43.000 --> 00:44:46.370
and the husband is the first to be suspected of murdering his wife.

00:44:52.680 --> 00:44:55.710
Maybe he’ll tell you something in his sleep.

00:44:55.880 --> 00:44:58.180
What if he's up to something and is waiting for me to fall asleep?

00:44:58.450 --> 00:45:00.080
-I can't fall asleep.
-I can't fall asleep.

00:46:01.150 --> 00:46:02.550
No.

00:46:03.080 --> 00:46:06.080
No! No, don't!

00:46:09.320 --> 00:46:12.190
No, don't!

00:46:12.260 --> 00:46:13.460
No.

00:46:13.460 --> 00:46:16.290
Hey. What's wrong with you?

00:46:16.290 --> 00:46:18.230
God. He might die like that.

00:46:18.230 --> 00:46:22.100
Hey. Wake up! Wake up, come on!

00:46:31.740 --> 00:46:33.340
Hwajin.

00:46:33.880 --> 00:46:36.380
You saved my life again.

00:46:36.380 --> 00:46:38.020
Thank you.

00:46:38.020 --> 00:46:41.090
Are you crazy?

00:46:41.090 --> 00:46:42.490
God.

00:46:43.690 --> 00:46:45.160
Hwajin.

00:46:48.490 --> 00:46:51.160
-My queen.
-Crap.

00:46:51.360 --> 00:46:54.630
Do you really think
that I will die if you beat me like that?

00:46:54.930 --> 00:46:56.930
Yes, you would have died if I had not woken you up.

00:46:56.930 --> 00:46:59.640
He squirmed like a worm.

00:47:00.300 --> 00:47:04.040
You hit me because I said another woman's name.

00:47:04.040 --> 00:47:06.310
No need to worry.

00:47:07.610 --> 00:47:09.850
I don't care who you call.

00:47:09.850 --> 00:47:12.820
Let's keep our distance.

00:47:15.050 --> 00:47:16.790
You said it again.

00:47:16.950 --> 00:47:18.220
Since you're up,

00:47:18.220 --> 00:47:20.460
you better come back to yourself

00:47:20.460 --> 00:47:22.630
and get a good night's sleep.

00:47:24.200 --> 00:47:28.870
If I leave now, I'll have to wake up my servants.
This is not good.

00:47:31.770 --> 00:47:34.110
How generous we are.

00:47:34.240 --> 00:47:37.410
Oh my queen, thank you for the compliment.

00:47:42.550 --> 00:47:44.550
God my queen.

00:47:44.550 --> 00:47:47.150
You're so selfish.

00:47:53.090 --> 00:47:55.560
Yes, you are a real strongwoman.

00:47:55.560 --> 00:47:57.430
Just lie down and go to sleep.

00:47:58.700 --> 00:48:02.200
A gracious king must be able to share.

00:48:22.590 --> 00:48:27.490
Whenever I sleep in Daejojeon, my whole body hurts.

00:48:28.730 --> 00:48:31.330
So we shouldn't sleep together anymore.

00:48:31.330 --> 00:48:33.630
It must be because
that I'm not used to this place.

00:48:33.630 --> 00:48:37.300
I need to stay more often until I get used to it.

00:48:38.570 --> 00:48:41.740
I don't want to wake up again because of your nightmares.

00:48:42.310 --> 00:48:44.110
I don't remember any nightmares

00:48:44.110 --> 00:48:46.310
and this is how they hit me for
that someone else called the name,

00:48:46.310 --> 00:48:48.280
I can't forget.

00:48:49.310 --> 00:48:53.080
Next time I'll say your name.

00:48:53.080 --> 00:48:55.490
I'll start from tonight.

00:48:58.390 --> 00:49:00.890
God, I even lost my appetite.

00:49:01.030 --> 00:49:04.090
If you've already eaten, you can go. I have things to do.

00:49:04.400 --> 00:49:06.800
What are you so busy with?

00:49:08.300 --> 00:49:09.730
Work.

00:49:09.800 --> 00:49:12.400
Since I can't use my phone or social media,

00:49:12.400 --> 00:49:14.810
then I have no choice but to work.

00:49:16.110 --> 00:49:17.980
Social networks?

00:49:17.980 --> 00:49:19.840
Social networks.

00:49:21.310 --> 00:49:25.450
I understand. Love should be tender.

00:49:26.880 --> 00:49:29.720
Tonight I will be tenderness itself.

00:49:42.970 --> 00:49:45.500
Direct hit!

00:49:46.640 --> 00:49:49.210
Fabulous!

00:49:49.210 --> 00:49:51.540
Where did you learn this?

00:49:51.610 --> 00:49:53.340
You're embarrassing me.

00:49:53.950 --> 00:49:57.680
Should I show what I'm capable of?

00:49:57.680 --> 00:49:59.180
So.

00:50:10.060 --> 00:50:11.530
Well then...

00:50:12.230 --> 00:50:13.900
Everything got so twisted and spun,

00:50:13.900 --> 00:50:16.230
In general, I spent several nights with the king.

00:50:16.400 --> 00:50:18.740
But we didn't sleep with him.

00:50:21.240 --> 00:50:23.010
We were only pretending.

00:50:23.210 --> 00:50:25.710
You know, he usually goes to his chambers.

00:50:26.780 --> 00:50:28.610
But yesterday it seemed like it had been replaced:

00:50:28.610 --> 00:50:30.580
he refused to go to his place.

00:50:30.650 --> 00:50:32.480
But don't worry.

00:50:32.480 --> 00:50:34.990
There was nothing at night, and nothing will happen in the future.

00:50:34.990 --> 00:50:39.720
Did you ask to meet to tell me this?

00:50:39.790 --> 00:50:41.290
No, not really.

00:50:41.290 --> 00:50:44.000
Did she really push me into the lake?

00:50:44.000 --> 00:50:45.600
And then too?

00:50:46.160 --> 00:50:49.700
Then you should slow down for a couple of days.

00:50:50.470 --> 00:50:53.870
It's so hard when a beautiful girl hates you.

00:50:54.310 --> 00:50:56.410
If only you didn't hate me.

00:50:58.480 --> 00:51:01.950
It seems the wind was not in your favor this time.

00:51:02.410 --> 00:51:05.480
If you trust me and wait a couple of days...

00:51:06.420 --> 00:51:10.390
Do you know who I definitely shouldn't trust in the palace?

00:51:11.790 --> 00:51:14.590
To you, Your Majesty. That's why

00:51:14.760 --> 00:51:17.900
I don't believe anything you said.

00:51:19.030 --> 00:51:23.230
And don't try to come between His Majesty and me yet,

00:51:23.230 --> 00:51:24.870
better give up.

00:51:24.870 --> 00:51:27.640
I started living from scratch.

00:51:27.710 --> 00:51:29.710
Can't you see how I've changed?

00:51:30.210 --> 00:51:32.010
You have changed for the worse.

00:51:32.010 --> 00:51:34.350
You smile in my face

00:51:34.550 --> 00:51:37.350
but behind my back, blame me for what happened on the lake.

00:51:37.680 --> 00:51:40.550
I never blamed you for this.

00:51:40.550 --> 00:51:41.820
We don't know who it was

00:51:41.820 --> 00:51:44.120
you are suspected because you were there.

00:51:44.120 --> 00:51:47.660
You know who it was.

00:51:52.930 --> 00:51:54.530
The person who did this is

00:51:55.570 --> 00:51:57.800
it's you, Your Majesty.

00:52:04.110 --> 00:52:06.640
You fell into the water on purpose

00:52:06.980 --> 00:52:09.350
to set me up.

00:52:17.790 --> 00:52:20.820
Judging by how angry she was, she wasn't lying.

00:52:21.630 --> 00:52:24.430
Now I know why she looks at me so coldly.

00:52:25.160 --> 00:52:29.170
The incident in the lake was fabricated. What remains is the killer.

00:52:30.100 --> 00:52:34.100
The fact that someone is following me doesn't change.

00:52:35.370 --> 00:52:39.210
Your Majesty, you need to return to Daejojeong Hall.

00:52:39.740 --> 00:52:42.080
Court Lady Choi
go first to Daejojeon.

00:52:45.020 --> 00:52:47.220
If something happens, think of something

00:52:47.220 --> 00:52:48.920
and send Hongyong for me.

00:52:48.920 --> 00:52:49.990
I don't dare...

00:52:49.990 --> 00:52:51.890
This is the only way you can help me.

00:52:52.290 --> 00:52:53.720
I beg you.

00:52:56.090 --> 00:52:58.060
Hey you, here.

00:53:00.100 --> 00:53:01.270
Royal chef.

00:53:01.270 --> 00:53:03.770
How often do you serve the Queen Dowager?

00:53:03.770 --> 00:53:05.840
I can't say for sure

00:53:05.840 --> 00:53:07.840
but several times a day for sure.

00:53:15.580 --> 00:53:18.150
I didn't mean to say this

00:53:18.150 --> 00:53:21.490
but in Joseon there are many who can
become a royal chef.

00:53:26.620 --> 00:53:28.130
I have breakfast, lunch, afternoon snack,

00:53:28.130 --> 00:53:29.330
light snacks, dinner

00:53:29.330 --> 00:53:32.200
and late night snacks.

00:53:32.260 --> 00:53:33.460
And she eats it all?

00:53:33.460 --> 00:53:35.470
Once every 3-4 days

00:53:35.600 --> 00:53:38.040
she refuses lunch.

00:53:38.040 --> 00:53:42.510
On such a day she asks for honey and ginger powder.

00:53:49.150 --> 00:53:50.710
She didn't eat

00:53:50.710 --> 00:53:53.620
cold and something that needs to be chewed.

00:53:53.620 --> 00:53:55.590
She didn't ask to change the menu,

00:53:55.590 --> 00:53:57.520
which means he wants to hide it.

00:53:59.460 --> 00:54:03.090
I look more at their faces than their skills.

00:54:03.660 --> 00:54:05.960
Aren't they all handsome?

00:54:06.760 --> 00:54:08.200
-Bam.
-Bam.

00:54:08.330 --> 00:54:09.800
Hey there!

00:54:09.930 --> 00:54:12.100
Do you think the sound of a shot is so quiet?

00:54:12.100 --> 00:54:15.270
Need to be louder. "Bam"!

00:54:15.270 --> 00:54:17.370
-Bam.
-Bam.

00:54:17.370 --> 00:54:19.910
Our dear Minister of War, your headdress is askew.

00:54:19.910 --> 00:54:23.010
What do you allow yourself?

00:54:23.580 --> 00:54:27.150
By the way, I heard you asked the king to transfer you

00:54:27.150 --> 00:54:28.750
to the Office of the Royal Guard.

00:54:28.750 --> 00:54:31.920
The management of the royal guard is not troops,

00:54:31.920 --> 00:54:33.660
you can laze there.

00:54:33.660 --> 00:54:35.160
There are rumors like this,

00:54:35.160 --> 00:54:37.360
and I thought: this is what I need.

00:54:37.360 --> 00:54:40.460
I don't like to strain myself.

00:54:53.640 --> 00:54:55.910
-When?
-This night.

00:54:55.910 --> 00:54:57.350
Fine.

00:55:05.090 --> 00:55:07.660
This is fly agaric powder.

00:55:07.660 --> 00:55:09.590
Odorless and tasteless.

00:55:09.590 --> 00:55:12.960
Mix it with alcohol and reveal all the secrets.

00:55:13.500 --> 00:55:16.700
But if the queen knew anything,

00:55:16.700 --> 00:55:18.570
she wouldn't sit silently.

00:55:18.600 --> 00:55:20.840
She's either up to something

00:55:20.940 --> 00:55:23.110
or waiting for the right moment.

00:55:23.470 --> 00:55:25.310
We need to make sure.

00:55:34.420 --> 00:55:37.220
Prince Yeonpyeong doesn't have enough ambition.

00:55:37.220 --> 00:55:39.920
He sticks to His Majesty

00:55:39.920 --> 00:55:42.860
and hangs around with Hong Byulgum

00:55:44.130 --> 00:55:46.000
at night.

00:55:49.300 --> 00:55:51.670
Hong Byulgam

00:55:52.000 --> 00:55:55.140
still the same slacker
shirking responsibilities.

00:55:55.810 --> 00:55:58.080
The Office of the Royal Guard is just a name.

00:55:58.080 --> 00:55:59.980
It's better to let him sit there.

00:56:00.780 --> 00:56:02.550
He lost not only his father and brother,

00:56:02.550 --> 00:56:05.450
but also his mother and grandparents right in front of his eyes.

00:56:05.780 --> 00:56:07.990
This served him as a lesson.

00:56:08.150 --> 00:56:13.160
By the way, when will you be appointed head of the royal guard?

00:56:13.890 --> 00:56:15.290
Is there some problem?

00:56:15.290 --> 00:56:18.930
I just want to get everything sorted out before his appointment.

00:56:22.570 --> 00:56:25.700
Have you profited from the exchange of military information again?

00:56:27.000 --> 00:56:28.910
Don't cross the line.

00:56:29.110 --> 00:56:31.140
How many times have I already told you,

00:56:31.140 --> 00:56:33.140
that an unstable army is very dangerous?

00:56:33.740 --> 00:56:35.210
I know.

00:56:35.880 --> 00:56:37.680
I'll take care of everything.

00:56:40.150 --> 00:56:41.790
No matter how much I think

00:56:42.350 --> 00:56:45.560
but I feel something dangerous is happening outside the palace.

00:56:45.560 --> 00:56:46.920
What are you talking about?

00:56:46.920 --> 00:56:50.330
On the way to Oktajeong a couple of days ago...

00:56:50.460 --> 00:56:52.730
Did you say Oktajeong?

00:56:52.730 --> 00:56:56.000
Yes. I made friends with one guy

00:56:56.000 --> 00:56:59.800
with the wonderful name Lee Sanman.

00:57:00.300 --> 00:57:01.970
Lee Senman.

00:57:02.170 --> 00:57:03.970
Do you know him?

00:57:04.510 --> 00:57:07.810
No. But the name seems familiar.

00:57:07.810 --> 00:57:10.210
He must be from a famous noble family.

00:57:10.210 --> 00:57:12.050
But I never heard his name.

00:57:12.920 --> 00:57:16.550
So, when we went with him to Oktajeong,

00:57:16.550 --> 00:57:19.520
suddenly someone hit me,

00:57:19.520 --> 00:57:21.430
and I lost consciousness.

00:57:22.330 --> 00:57:23.930
When I woke up

00:57:23.930 --> 00:57:29.430
I realized that Lee Senman had disappeared like a ghost.

00:57:29.470 --> 00:57:31.940
Remember how he was dressed?

00:57:31.940 --> 00:57:34.170
-Certainly.
-On it

00:57:36.040 --> 00:57:38.880
Were there any clothes made from this fabric?

00:57:45.020 --> 00:57:46.450
No.

00:57:50.090 --> 00:57:51.520
It's clear.

00:57:51.590 --> 00:57:54.460
If you see your friend again,

00:57:54.460 --> 00:57:56.960
find out what happened then.

00:57:57.230 --> 00:57:58.900
Does this mean

00:57:59.900 --> 00:58:03.230
that you are giving me a special task?

00:58:03.230 --> 00:58:05.500
I wouldn't call it a special task.

00:58:07.940 --> 00:58:09.410
By the way.

00:58:09.740 --> 00:58:13.180
You come to the palace every day, but you do nothing.

00:58:13.180 --> 00:58:15.280
What do you mean I'm not doing anything?

00:58:15.280 --> 00:58:17.210
And the whole day is not enough,

00:58:17.210 --> 00:58:19.120
just to greet everyone.

00:58:22.550 --> 00:58:25.160
This assignment is perfect for you.

00:58:25.520 --> 00:58:27.420
A real special assignment.

00:58:27.860 --> 00:58:29.630
Finally.

00:58:47.510 --> 00:58:51.310
(Social distancing)

00:58:54.890 --> 00:58:57.320
(Social distancing)

00:59:00.660 --> 00:59:02.090
Your Majesty.

00:59:02.090 --> 00:59:04.290
Prince Yeonpyeong has arrived.

00:59:04.290 --> 00:59:05.700
Yes.

00:59:10.230 --> 00:59:13.640
Do you know what this means?

00:59:13.940 --> 00:59:15.370
Sorry?

00:59:15.940 --> 00:59:17.810
Come and take a look.

00:59:22.210 --> 00:59:23.550
Social distancing?

00:59:23.550 --> 00:59:27.280
According to the queen, this means "Let's live happily."

00:59:27.280 --> 00:59:29.950
But where do the words originate?

00:59:32.690 --> 00:59:34.890
Never heard of it.

00:59:36.930 --> 00:59:39.830
Or maybe from Buddhist scriptures?

00:59:49.340 --> 00:59:52.280
I would have tea with my brother.

00:59:52.610 --> 00:59:54.950
Yes, Your Majesty.

01:00:04.420 --> 01:00:06.660
I keep thinking about what the queen said

01:00:06.660 --> 01:00:10.260
because some of her wonderful words
may have some significance.

01:00:10.360 --> 01:00:11.860
Yes.

01:00:14.700 --> 01:00:16.400
Here's what you asked for.

01:00:17.940 --> 01:00:19.640
Great job.

01:00:21.570 --> 01:00:23.170
Will this happen today?

01:00:23.270 --> 01:00:25.310
The faster the better.

01:00:27.510 --> 01:00:28.980
Right.

01:00:30.080 --> 01:00:32.050
Give me more clay.

01:00:32.850 --> 01:00:34.250
Yeah.

01:00:37.320 --> 01:00:39.560
This is your order

01:00:39.560 --> 01:00:41.390
but if you ruin the oven...

01:00:41.390 --> 01:00:44.160
I won't spoil it. This is an upgrade.

01:00:44.830 --> 01:00:46.900
What a crazy person.

01:00:54.370 --> 01:00:58.310
Hey, you crazy guy, what are these little stones!

01:00:59.010 --> 01:01:00.610
What? Hard?

01:01:00.910 --> 01:01:03.280
Let me help. This one is perfect.

01:01:03.280 --> 01:01:04.380
Too big.

01:01:04.380 --> 01:01:06.020
Why are you putting this?

01:01:06.020 --> 01:01:08.450
-Your Majesty!
-Oil, or what?

01:01:08.450 --> 01:01:11.520
Yes. As you ordered, I brought everything
varieties - rapeseed, sesame, peril

01:01:11.520 --> 01:01:13.490
and in general everything that I found.

01:01:13.490 --> 01:01:15.460
Well, you're great.

01:01:20.430 --> 01:01:22.230
Such a jewel!

01:01:22.230 --> 01:01:25.270
Your Majesty. This is our annual supply of oil.

01:01:25.570 --> 01:01:27.640
Cooking is 80% ingredients.

01:01:27.640 --> 01:01:29.540
My fate depends on this food.

01:01:30.640 --> 01:01:31.710
Your Majesty.

01:01:31.710 --> 01:01:34.810
His Majesty has long gone to his chambers.

01:01:34.810 --> 01:01:36.780
Tell me, I have a child's duty here.

01:01:36.780 --> 01:01:39.520
No no. I poured everything out, everything.

01:01:58.200 --> 01:02:01.170
How could you all of ours
bring her precious gifts?

01:02:01.170 --> 01:02:04.110
Yes, I would already be lying in the earth if I hadn’t brought it.

01:02:04.440 --> 01:02:06.710
If we threaten, they will drag us even more.

01:02:06.710 --> 01:02:08.480
Why are you shaking?

01:02:13.950 --> 01:02:16.820
Doesn't even weigh it. What is she going to do?

01:02:21.260 --> 01:02:24.860
These are such valuable ingredients.

01:02:30.470 --> 01:02:33.670
Okay, it's ready. Great.

01:02:36.840 --> 01:02:39.210
Well done.

01:02:39.210 --> 01:02:41.010
-Take this.
-Yes.

01:02:41.010 --> 01:02:43.180
-Put it there.
-What?

01:02:43.180 --> 01:02:45.550
- I say, put it there.
-Yes, Your Majesty.

01:02:55.490 --> 01:02:57.130
Ready.

01:02:57.960 --> 01:03:01.330
Croaker of the highest quality -
and just threw it into the fire.

01:03:01.330 --> 01:03:04.500
Well, what kind of quirks.

01:03:22.350 --> 01:03:25.290
Your Majesty, I beg your pardon,
if I overstep the boundaries,

01:03:25.290 --> 01:03:27.960
but Her Majesty is in the royal kitchen

01:03:27.960 --> 01:03:31.360
supervises the preparation of food for the dowager queen.

01:03:31.830 --> 01:03:35.100
Understand. I'll wait.

01:03:35.400 --> 01:03:37.570
I'm sorry.

01:03:49.650 --> 01:03:52.250
She's avoiding me.

01:04:30.020 --> 01:04:31.220
Are you okay?

01:04:31.220 --> 01:04:33.490
Damn, I passed out for some reason.

01:04:39.700 --> 01:04:42.200
My destiny depends on you.

01:04:57.780 --> 01:04:59.850
It will burn.

01:05:13.230 --> 01:05:14.700
Tell her.

01:05:17.500 --> 01:05:21.470
I told you I don't need breakfast.

01:05:22.640 --> 01:05:26.610
The Queen prepared it herself.

01:05:30.480 --> 01:05:33.920
-Has the Queen prepared it?
-Yes, Your Majesty.

01:05:34.320 --> 01:05:38.320
I spent the whole night on this.

01:05:38.320 --> 01:05:40.590
I'm grateful for the effort

01:05:43.560 --> 01:05:46.430
but what is it even made of?

01:05:46.430 --> 01:05:48.500
Looks different.

01:05:48.800 --> 01:05:50.900
She cooked from beef, pork

01:05:50.900 --> 01:05:55.370
and croaker - all together.

01:05:55.740 --> 01:05:59.510
More like embroidery than food.

01:06:01.210 --> 01:06:03.480
I really have no appetite

01:06:03.480 --> 01:06:06.850
but you say she spent the whole night.

01:06:06.850 --> 01:06:09.120
I'm grateful, so I'll try a piece.

01:06:36.180 --> 01:06:38.050
Still no news?

01:06:38.750 --> 01:06:40.250
Yes.

01:06:45.120 --> 01:06:47.190
It won't work that way. I'll go myself.

01:06:47.190 --> 01:06:50.360
The Queen Dowager has arrived.

01:07:05.240 --> 01:07:08.810
-Victory?
-How could you?

01:07:11.480 --> 01:07:12.950
Fiasco?

01:07:15.520 --> 01:07:18.720
Why did you hide such talent?

01:07:18.890 --> 01:07:20.290
What?

01:07:21.490 --> 01:07:25.160
I don't even know what time it is
I didn't enjoy the food that much.

01:07:25.160 --> 01:07:27.400
I'm so excited about food

01:07:27.400 --> 01:07:29.630
That made me really angry!

01:07:30.670 --> 01:07:32.500
Triumph.

01:07:34.170 --> 01:07:37.310
I'm glad you liked it.

01:07:37.440 --> 01:07:39.810
Of course I liked it.

01:07:39.810 --> 01:07:42.880
I feel like I could eat this every day.

01:07:43.050 --> 01:07:44.980
How did you prepare this?

01:07:44.980 --> 01:07:47.950
I've never tasted such a soft texture before,

01:07:47.950 --> 01:07:50.520
and what a rich taste.

01:07:51.820 --> 01:07:57.700
I cooked in oil for very
small fire all night.

01:07:59.430 --> 01:08:01.730
I put the fish in oil on the coals in the oven,

01:08:01.730 --> 01:08:03.300
to cook slowly all night.

01:08:03.300 --> 01:08:07.270
I wanted the crust to be crispy and the meat tender.

01:08:07.370 --> 01:08:10.610
To make the meat chew better,
I put it in a cauldron with oil

01:08:10.610 --> 01:08:13.810
and cooked on low heat overnight.

01:08:14.880 --> 01:08:18.380
This method saves
both the food's nutrients and its smell.

01:08:18.450 --> 01:08:21.850
It is also good for health and
helps against aging.

01:08:21.850 --> 01:08:23.290
Very healthy food.

01:08:23.290 --> 01:08:27.990
This is called confit -
French cooking technique.

01:08:27.990 --> 01:08:30.960
Not only tasty, but also healthy?

01:08:32.560 --> 01:08:35.730
Where did you learn this method?

01:08:36.700 --> 01:08:38.670
Maybe this is an insight?

01:08:38.670 --> 01:08:41.940
After all, I was thinking about how to please Your Majesty,

01:08:41.940 --> 01:08:44.740
for so many days now.

01:08:47.380 --> 01:08:50.380
Well, a fatal blow.

01:08:50.380 --> 01:08:52.550
I will help you every day.

01:08:52.950 --> 01:08:54.520
Until the end of days

01:08:54.750 --> 01:08:56.150
you will be young

01:08:56.690 --> 01:08:58.590
and healthy.

01:09:07.030 --> 01:09:11.300
I allow the lake to be filled with water.

01:09:31.590 --> 01:09:33.260
You will fill it like this until Joseon collapses.

01:09:33.260 --> 01:09:36.090
We need ten days, no less.

01:09:36.530 --> 01:09:38.730
What? So that in a minute there will be water

01:09:38.730 --> 01:09:41.000
or I'll blow your heads off!

01:09:41.030 --> 01:09:44.100
Faster, faster!

01:09:48.240 --> 01:09:52.440
Now we need two more days.

01:09:53.180 --> 01:09:54.810
Stand still, don't move!

01:09:57.750 --> 01:10:00.350
I came up with something.

01:10:00.450 --> 01:10:03.590
Life-giving water is flowing!

01:10:04.290 --> 01:10:06.190
-Hold it.
-Thank you.

01:10:06.190 --> 01:10:08.690
Life-giving water is flowing!

01:10:09.390 --> 01:10:12.430
Who knew that things would go faster this way?

01:10:12.430 --> 01:10:14.800
Well done! Just like that!

01:10:15.330 --> 01:10:17.870
-Take it quickly.
-Hold it.

01:10:27.210 --> 01:10:30.080
Yes, I am not a queen, but a genius of local thought.

01:10:30.080 --> 01:10:31.750
Well done. Great fellows.

01:10:31.750 --> 01:10:35.050
Until the lake is filled, forget about sleep.

01:10:35.050 --> 01:10:36.520
- We obey!
- We obey!

01:10:55.170 --> 01:10:56.910
Hongyeon, then?

01:10:57.510 --> 01:11:00.580
If she's faking it,

01:11:00.680 --> 01:11:05.680
then he certainly won’t be able to trick me.

01:11:19.730 --> 01:11:22.100
The fabric is really rare,

01:11:22.100 --> 01:11:26.000
I can't tell you where it was woven.

01:11:31.410 --> 01:11:33.510
But I can

01:11:34.180 --> 01:11:36.880
try to find out.

01:11:37.580 --> 01:11:41.750
You can’t give up without trying, don’t you agree?

01:11:41.750 --> 01:11:43.890
I like your approach.

01:11:47.660 --> 01:11:51.560
I was worried about
that the king doesn't care about the queen,

01:11:51.560 --> 01:11:54.400
but it seems that all my worries have come to an end.

01:11:56.300 --> 01:11:58.100
What else can you tell me?

01:11:58.700 --> 01:12:01.870
Last night while the queen

01:12:01.870 --> 01:12:04.240
was in the palace kitchen,

01:12:04.240 --> 01:12:06.610
the king waited alone for her

01:12:06.610 --> 01:12:09.880
at Daejojeon Hall.

01:12:10.050 --> 01:12:14.320
I advised the king to go to Hwijojong Hall,
but he said he wasn't going anywhere.

01:12:15.450 --> 01:12:20.460
I can't believe our king
so worried about his wife!

01:12:20.560 --> 01:12:23.660
Got it, you can go.

01:12:24.760 --> 01:12:26.230
Fine.

01:12:30.500 --> 01:12:32.100
Let them spend more nights together,

01:12:32.100 --> 01:12:34.170
this way feelings will flare up between them faster.

01:12:34.870 --> 01:12:37.910
The Queen gave me her royal word.

01:12:38.210 --> 01:12:39.510
Did you give your word?

01:12:39.510 --> 01:12:42.380
She promised to conceive a prince.

01:12:42.380 --> 01:12:43.780
What are you talking about?

01:12:43.780 --> 01:12:45.580
Then in our family

01:12:45.580 --> 01:12:48.220
will a blood heir to the throne be born?

01:12:50.920 --> 01:12:52.620
What is this?

01:12:53.260 --> 01:12:54.690
Exactly,

01:12:55.760 --> 01:12:57.260
look.

01:12:57.330 --> 01:13:01.030
Eat and your skin will become
like a baby.

01:13:01.330 --> 01:13:03.570
What an expensive gift.

01:13:04.600 --> 01:13:06.070
If you like his action,

01:13:06.070 --> 01:13:09.570
I won’t regret anything, but I’ll find you more.

01:13:10.310 --> 01:13:11.840
Thank you.

01:13:14.110 --> 01:13:17.680
I still can't believe it
that everything turned out so great.

01:13:17.680 --> 01:13:21.020
When the queen fell into the lake

01:13:21.020 --> 01:13:23.490
I almost went crazy with excitement!

01:13:24.090 --> 01:13:25.620
Poor, innocent child.

01:13:25.620 --> 01:13:29.090
I'm so proud that she made it
maintain your high position.

01:13:29.830 --> 01:13:32.460
Tears well up from happiness.

01:13:33.100 --> 01:13:35.000
Tell it like it is.

01:13:35.000 --> 01:13:37.300
I'll be honest, the queen is not an innocent child at all.

01:13:37.300 --> 01:13:40.470
Our queen...
What is the correct way to say it?

01:13:42.340 --> 01:13:43.840
Smart?

01:13:44.810 --> 01:13:46.410
A little is the wrong word.

01:13:47.110 --> 01:13:50.080
-Scrupulous?
-Not that.

01:13:50.150 --> 01:13:52.980
There is a perfect word.

01:13:53.450 --> 01:13:55.950
-Then...
- Sophisticated?

01:13:56.120 --> 01:13:57.620
What are you talking about?

01:14:00.760 --> 01:14:02.290
Unique?

01:14:02.460 --> 01:14:05.630
Exactly! Unique girl.

01:14:05.630 --> 01:14:08.030
We couldn't find a better queen!

01:14:08.030 --> 01:14:09.700
Exactly, exactly!

01:14:09.770 --> 01:14:14.040
I look at her and see you in your youth!

01:14:14.240 --> 01:14:15.870
What nonsense!

01:14:23.450 --> 01:14:24.780
Have you gone off the rails?

01:14:24.780 --> 01:14:27.720
Have you seen this with your own eyes?
These ones?

01:14:27.720 --> 01:14:30.320
At least someone in the palace personally saw

01:14:30.320 --> 01:14:32.220
for the concubine to push the queen?

01:14:33.090 --> 01:14:35.490
Was it worth it?
Everyone already knows it’s her!

01:14:35.490 --> 01:14:37.160
-Exactly!
-She's right.

01:14:37.160 --> 01:14:38.260
Yes, everyone knows about this.

01:14:38.260 --> 01:14:42.130
As they say, a thief's cap is on fire.

01:14:42.630 --> 01:14:44.400
These rumors did not come out of thin air.

01:14:49.940 --> 01:14:51.410
How dare you!

01:14:51.410 --> 01:14:54.480
Get ready! Tomorrow morning there will be a rumor
what a bald fool you are!

01:14:54.480 --> 01:14:55.780
Oh you bastard!

01:14:55.780 --> 01:14:57.650
Let me go! Now!

01:14:57.650 --> 01:14:59.280
Let me go!

01:14:59.750 --> 01:15:01.950
The Queen set her up!

01:15:01.950 --> 01:15:03.620
When my lady passed by,

01:15:03.620 --> 01:15:05.890
The queen jumped into the water on purpose!

01:15:05.890 --> 01:15:08.060
Before you talk, find out the truth!

01:15:24.510 --> 01:15:26.610
Today I definitely...

01:15:52.170 --> 01:15:55.970
Your Majesty, I thought
you will practice writing.

01:15:56.140 --> 01:15:57.910
When I went to Yejang,

01:15:57.910 --> 01:16:00.510
to play tudjon with Mr. Hong,

01:16:00.510 --> 01:16:02.980
I saw something that amazed me.

01:16:05.780 --> 01:16:10.120
Someone from a long distance
threw a dagger at the target.

01:16:12.690 --> 01:16:15.290
I thought why don't I try it.

01:16:16.560 --> 01:16:18.260
It's very dangerous

01:16:18.260 --> 01:16:20.430
what if you get hurt?

01:16:28.470 --> 01:16:31.240
How long have we known each other?

01:16:33.510 --> 01:16:36.410
Two years, sir.

01:16:39.950 --> 01:16:41.350
Here's how.

01:16:45.090 --> 01:16:48.860
During this time you learned everything in the world about me,

01:16:48.860 --> 01:16:50.630
became my arms and legs.

01:16:50.630 --> 01:16:53.630
It's as if we've known each other for years.

01:16:54.630 --> 01:16:57.900
I'm just doing my job.

01:16:58.070 --> 01:16:59.570
Your job?

01:17:01.970 --> 01:17:03.710
Maybe this is your job too

01:17:03.710 --> 01:17:05.240
but I can't stop thinking about

01:17:05.240 --> 01:17:08.110
are you devoted to me because you have to

01:17:08.610 --> 01:17:10.080
or

01:17:11.080 --> 01:17:14.150
because that's what you want.

01:17:15.750 --> 01:17:17.990
I'm sure your feelings are sincere.

01:17:19.990 --> 01:17:22.960
Thank you for noticing, sir!

01:17:22.960 --> 01:17:24.860
Do you believe me?

01:17:25.360 --> 01:17:28.630
If not for you, then for whom?

01:17:36.040 --> 01:17:37.710
I thought it would be easier.

01:17:38.110 --> 01:17:42.010
But did you doubt me?

01:17:44.680 --> 01:17:47.220
Please forgive me.

01:17:47.220 --> 01:17:49.920
As I got older, I became more cowardly.

01:17:51.620 --> 01:17:54.390
Tonight
I'll go to Daejojeon Hall early.

01:17:54.490 --> 01:17:56.360
I'll prepare everything.

01:18:32.960 --> 01:18:35.830
To meet you
I should have arrived earlier.

01:18:37.200 --> 01:18:39.270
How diligent you are, though.

01:18:39.270 --> 01:18:41.170
So much effort just so we can sleep.

01:18:41.170 --> 01:18:43.810
We have prepared drinks and snacks.

01:18:44.940 --> 01:18:46.110
Why else is this?

01:18:46.110 --> 01:18:48.110
I know you like to drink

01:18:48.110 --> 01:18:50.280
so I ordered them to be prepared for you.

01:18:50.350 --> 01:18:51.980
I'm done with this.

01:18:53.950 --> 01:18:56.050
I thought about this too.

01:18:57.420 --> 01:18:59.690
We brought treats for tea.

01:19:12.370 --> 01:19:14.270
This is Arabic jasmine tea.

01:19:15.270 --> 01:19:17.740
If you suffer from insomnia or anxiety,

01:19:17.740 --> 01:19:19.610
he will calm you down.

01:19:26.750 --> 01:19:28.650
Jasmine Gull?

01:19:28.820 --> 01:19:31.090
What a strong smell.

01:19:40.630 --> 01:19:44.100
That night the whole room smelled of jasmine.

01:19:48.970 --> 01:19:52.910
The smell even lingered on his sleeve.

01:20:25.240 --> 01:20:26.740
It was you.

01:20:29.680 --> 01:20:31.280
It's you...

01:20:31.850 --> 01:20:34.450
You shouldn’t reveal all your cards so recklessly.

01:20:37.790 --> 01:20:43.290
Especially in the palace, where everyone has their own secrets.

01:20:55.240 --> 01:20:56.640
How I became queen

01:21:16.490 --> 01:21:18.960
Have I fallen into the trap of her deceitful eyes and words?

01:21:18.960 --> 01:21:20.730
Make her tell you everything.

01:21:20.730 --> 01:21:22.900
-Who sent the letter?
-The Dowager Queen.

01:21:22.900 --> 01:21:24.470
Only until the lake is filled with water.

01:21:24.470 --> 01:21:26.870
I will endure all this and then return home.

01:21:26.870 --> 01:21:28.640
The person we are looking for is a lady of the court.

01:21:28.640 --> 01:21:31.540
Do everything to avoid getting caught.

01:21:31.540 --> 01:21:34.010
I found out where this fabric came from.

01:21:34.010 --> 01:21:35.280
From the palace.

01:21:35.280 --> 01:21:37.250
Your need is a royal spouse, not me.

01:21:37.250 --> 01:21:39.850
Do you want everything back?
This is revenge.

01:21:39.850 --> 01:21:42.620
-That's what I did to you.
-Do you think I can’t?
